<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport">
  <title>6figure</title>
  <meta name="description" content="">
  <meta name="keywords" content="">


  <!-- Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect">
  <link href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;0,900;1,100;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,700;1,900&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900&family=Source+Sans+Pro:ital,wght@0,200;0,300;0,400;0,600;0,700;0,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->

  <!-- Bootstrap JS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

  <!-- Vendor CSS Files -->
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'vendors/aos/aos', 'data-turbo-track': 'reload' %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'vendors/glightbox/css/glightbox', 'data-turbo-track': 'reload' %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'vendors/swiper/swiper-bundle.min', 'data-turbo-track': 'reload' %>

  <!-- Main CSS File -->
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'vendors/css/main', 'data-turbo-track': 'reload' %>
</head>

<body class="index-page" style="background-color: #181a1b;">

<header id="header" class="header d-flex align-items-center sticky-top" style="background-color: #181a1b;">
  <div class="container-fluid position-relative d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">

    <a href="index.html" class="logo d-flex align-items-center me-auto me-xl-0">
      <!-- Uncomment the line below if you also wish to use an image logo -->
      <!-- <img src="assets/img/logo.png" alt=""> -->
      <h1 class="sitename">6figure</h1>
      <span>.</span>
    </a>

    <nav id="navmenu" class="navmenu">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#hero" class="active">Home<br></a></li>
        <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
      <i class="mobile-nav-toggle d-xl-none bi bi-list"></i>
    </nav>

    <a class="btn-getstarted" href="<%= login_path %>">Get Started</a>

  </div>

  <style>
      #hero {
          position: relative;
          overflow: hidden;
          height: 70vh;
      }

      .video-background {
          position: absolute;
          top: 0;
          left: 0;
          width: 100%;
          height: 100%;
          overflow: hidden;
      }

      .video-background video {
          width: 100%;
          height: 100%;
          object-fit: cover;
      }

      .container {
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1200px) {
          .navmenu a, .navmenu a:focus {
              color: #b2aba1;
          }
      }

      /* Global Styling */
      body, .index-page, main, section, .dark-background {
          background-color: #121212 !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Section Background */
      section {
          background-color: #181a1b !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Header */
      #header {
          background-color: #181a1b !important;
      }

      .navmenu a, .navmenu a:focus {
          color: #b2aba1 !important;
      }

      /* Card Styling */
      .iq-card {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          border: none;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      /* Card Header */
      .iq-card-header {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Card Body */
      .iq-card-body {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Badge */
      .iq-card-header-toolbar .badge-primary {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Text Color for Headers and Card Titles */
      .iq-header-title h4, .card-title, .media-support-info h6, .media-support-info p, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Button Styling */
      .buy-btn, .btn-getstarted, .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .cta-btn, .scroll-top, .stretched-link {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
          border: none !important;
      }

      /* Modal Background */
      .modal-content {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Section Titles */
      .section-title h2, .section-title p, .iq-header-title h4, .iq-card-title, .faq-item h3 {
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Tabs */
      .nav-tabs .nav-link {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
          border: 1px solid #333 !important;
      }

      .nav-tabs .nav-link.active {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Table Styling */
      .table {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
          border-color: #333 !important;
      }

      .table th, .table td {
          border-color: #333 !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* FAQ */
      .faq-container .faq-item h3 {
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      .faq-icon, .faq-toggle {
          color: #b2aba1 !important;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
          background-color: #181a1b !important;
          color: #b2aba1 !important;
      }

      .footer .social-links i {
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* FAQ Section Background */
      #faq .faq-container .faq-item {
          background-color: #1f1f1f !important;
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
          border: 1px solid #333 !important;
          border-radius: 8px;
          padding: 15px;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      /* FAQ Question Text Color */
      #faq .faq-container .faq-item h3 {
          color: #ffffff !important;
          font-weight: bold;
      }

      /* FAQ Answer Text Color */
      #faq .faq-container .faq-content {
          color: #cccccc !important;
      }

      /* FAQ Icons */
      .faq-icon, .faq-toggle {
          color: #e0e0e0 !important;
      }

      /* Hover Effect for FAQ Items */
      #faq .faq-container .faq-item:hover {
          background-color: #292929 !important;
          border-color: #555 !important;
      }

      /* Call-To-Action Section Text Color */
      #call-to-action, #call-to-action h4, #call-to-action p {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      /* Ensuring Buttons in Call-To-Action Section are Visible */
      #call-to-action .cta-btn {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      /* Contact Section Styling */
      #contact {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      #contact .info {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
          padding: 20px;
          border-radius: 5px;
      }

      #contact .info h3,
      #contact .info h4 {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      #contact .info-item i {
          color: #40E0D0 !important;
      }

      .btn-getstarted {
          background-color: #40E0D0 !important;
      }

      #contact .info-item p,
      #contact .info-item a {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      #contact .php-email-form input,
      #contact .php-email-form textarea {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
          border: 1px solid #555 !important;
      }

      #contact .php-email-form input::placeholder,
      #contact .php-email-form textarea::placeholder {
          color: #aaaaaa !important;
      }

      #contact .php-email-form button {
          background-color: #40E0D0 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
          border: none;
      }

      /* Pricing Section - Ensure Text is Visible on Dark Background */
      .pricing-item {
          background-color: #181a1b !important;
          border: 1px solid #333 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
          border-radius: 10px;
          box-shadow: 0px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      .pricing-header {
          background-color: #40E0D0 !important;
          color: #ffffff;
          padding: 20px;
          border-top-left-radius: 10px;
          border-top-right-radius: 10px;
      }

      .pricing-header h3,
      .pricing-header h4 {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      .pricing-item ul li {
          color: #ffffff !important;
          font-size: 14px;
      }

      .pricing-item ul li i {
          color: #40E0D0 !important;
      }

      .pricing-item .buy-btn {
          background-color: #333 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
          border: none;
          padding: 10px 20px;
          border-radius: 5px;
          transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      }

      .pricing-item .buy-btn:hover {
          background-color: #40E0D0 !important;
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      .section-title h2 {
          color: #ffffff !important;
      }

      .section-title p {
          color: #bbbbbb !important;
      }


  </style>
</header>

<main class="main" style="background-color: #181a1b;">

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section id="hero" class="hero section mb-5">
    <div class="video-background">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
        <source src="<%= asset_path('win.mp4') %>" type="video/mp4">
        Your browser does not support the video tag.
      </video>
    </div>
    <div class="container d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center text-center position-relative" data-aos="zoom-out">
      <div class="d-flex">
        <a href="<%= login_path %>" class="btn-get-started scrollto">Get Started</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7f98aduVJ8" class="glightbox btn-watch-video d-flex align-items-center"><i class="bi bi-play-circle"></i><span>Watch Tutorial</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section><!-- /Hero Section -->

  <!-- Pricing Section -->

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
      <% investment_plan = InvestmentPlan.where(is_active: true) %>
      <% trading_plan = TradingPlan.where(is_active: true) %>
      <% staking_plan = Staking.where(is_active: true) %>


      <div class="iq-card">
        <div class="iq-card-header d-flex justify-content-between">
          <div class="iq-header-title">
            <h4 class="card-title">Plans</h4>
          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="iq-card-body">
          <ul class="nav nav-pills mb-3 nav-fill profile-feed-items" id="pills-tab-1" role="tablist">
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link active" id="pills-home-tab-fill" data-toggle="pill" href="#pills-home-fill" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-home" aria-selected="true">Investment
                Plan</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link" id="pills-profile-tab-fill" data-toggle="pill" href="#pills-profile-fill" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-profile" aria-selected="false">Trading
                Plan</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link" id="pills-contact-tab-fill" data-toggle="pill" href="#pills-contact-fill" role="tab" aria-controls="pills-contact" aria-selected="false">Staking</a>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="tab-content" id="pills-tabContent-1">
            <!-- Investment Plan Tab -->
            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="pills-home-fill" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-home-tab-fill">
              <div>
                <section id="pricing" class="pricing section">
                  <!-- Section Title -->
                  <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <h2>Our Pricing</h2>
                    <p>Investment Plan</p>
                  </div><!-- End Section Title -->

                  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

                    <div class="row gy-4">
                      <% investment_plan.each do |investment| %>

                        <div class="col-lg-4" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
                          <div class="pricing-item featured">

                            <div class="pricing-header">
                              <h3><%= investment.name.titleize %></h3>
                              <h4><sup>$</sup><%= investment.price %><span></span></h4>
                            </div>

                            <ul>
                              <li><i class="bi bi-dot"></i> <span><%= investment.description %></span></li>

                            </ul>

                            <div class="text-center mt-auto">
                              <%= link_to "Buy", new_purchase_path(plan_id: investment.id, plan_type: 'InvestmentPlan'), class: 'buy-btn' %>
                            </div>

                          </div>
                        </div>
                      <% end %>

                    </div>

                  </div>

                </section>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Trading Plan Tab -->
            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-profile-fill" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-profile-tab-fill">
              <div>
                <section id="pricing" class="pricing section">
                  <!-- Section Title -->
                  <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <h2>Our Pricing</h2>
                    <p>Trading Plan</p>
                  </div><!-- End Section Title -->

                  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

                    <div class="row gy-4">
                      <% trading_plan.each do |trading| %>

                        <div class="col-lg-4" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
                          <div class="pricing-item featured">

                            <div class="pricing-header">
                              <h3><%= trading.name.titleize %></h3>
                              <h4><sup>$</sup><%= trading.price %><span></span></h4>
                            </div>

                            <ul>
                              <li><i class="bi bi-dot"></i> <span><%= trading.description %></span></li>

                            </ul>

                            <div class="text-center mt-auto">
                              <%= link_to "Buy", new_purchase_path(plan_id: trading.id, plan_type: 'TradingPlan'), class: 'buy-btn' %>

                            </div>

                          </div>
                        </div>
                      <% end %>

                    </div>

                  </div>

                </section>

              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Staking Plan Tab -->
            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-contact-fill" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pills-contact-tab-fill">
              <div>
                <section id="pricing" class="pricing section">
                  <!-- Section Title -->
                  <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <h2>Our Pricing</h2>
                    <p>Staking Plan</p>
                  </div><!-- End Section Title -->

                  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">

                    <div class="row gy-4">
                      <% staking_plan.each do |staking| %>

                        <div class="col-lg-4" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
                          <div class="pricing-item featured">

                            <div class="pricing-header">
                              <h3><%= staking.name.titleize %></h3>
                              <h4><sup>$</sup><%= staking.price %><span></span></h4>
                            </div>

                            <ul>
                              <li><i class="bi bi-dot"></i> <span><%= staking.description %></span></li>

                            </ul>

                            <div class="text-center mt-auto">
                              <%= link_to "Buy", new_purchase_path(plan_id: staking.id, plan_type: 'Staking'), class: 'buy-btn' %>
                            </div>

                          </div>
                        </div>

                        </div>
                      <% end %>

                      </div>

                </section>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bootstrap Modal for Confirmation -->
      <div class="modal fade" id="cancelConfirmationModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="cancelConfirmationModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
          <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
              <h5 class="modal-title" id="cancelConfirmationModalLabel">Confirm Cancellation</h5>
              <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
              Are you sure you want to cancel this plan?
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
              <a id="confirm-cancel" href="#" class="btn btn-danger">Confirm Cancel</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- /Pricing Section -->


  <!-- About Section -->
  <section id="about" class="about section">

    <!-- Section Title -->
    <div class="container section-title" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <h5>Empowering Your Financial Future Through Strategic Investment</h5>
      <p>we empower individuals to achieve their financial goals through tailored investment strategies, active trading,
        and innovative staking solutions.
        Our dedicated team prioritizes transparency and client satisfaction, ensuring your portfolio is optimized for
        growth.
        Join us on your journey to financial success and unlock your investment potential.
      </p>
    </div><!-- End Section Title -->

    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">

      <div class="row g-4 g-lg-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <div class="about-img">
            <img src="<%= asset_path "make.png" %>" class="img-fluid" alt="">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <h3 class="pt-0 pt-lg-5">What makes us the right choice?</h3>

          <!-- Tabs -->
          <ul class="nav nav-pills mb-3">
            <li><a class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="pill" href="#Investment">Investment</a></li>
            <li><a class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="pill" href="#Trading">Trading</a></li>
            <li><a class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="pill" href="#Staking">Staking</a></li>
          </ul><!-- End Tabs -->

          <!-- Tab Content -->
          <div class="tab-content">

            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="Investment">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving
                consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Expert Fund Management</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our experienced team of fund managers uses proven strategies to maximize returns while mitigating risk.
                We work closely with you to develop personalized investment plans tailored to your financial goals.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Diversified Investment Portfolios</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We manage diversified portfolios across a wide range of industries and asset classes. This approach
                helps spread risk and capture opportunities in different sectors, ensuring steady growth.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Long-Term Growth Focus</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We prioritize long-term, sustainable growth over short-term gains. By investing with patience and
                discipline, we aim to build your wealth steadily, securing your financial future.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Risk Management Strategies</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our sophisticated risk management strategies are designed to protect your capital in volatile market
                conditions. We constantly monitor and adjust portfolios to keep your investments secure and
                profitable.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent and Personalized Service</h4>
              </div>
              <p> We believe in transparency and keep you informed every step of the way. Our personalized service
                ensures you understand your investments and feel confident in your financial journey.</p>

            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="Trading">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving
                consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Informed Market Insights</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our team provides timely and accurate market analysis to Perform trading decisions. With expert
                insights, We navigate the complexities of the market and seize profitable opportunities.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Tailored Trading Strategies</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We develop personalized trading strategies that align with your investment goals and risk tolerance.
                This customized approach ensures we have a clear plan that adapts to market conditions.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Advanced Trading Techniques</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Utilizing sophisticated trading techniques and tools, we aim to maximize your returns. Our experts
                employ various strategies, from technical analysis to trend-following, to enhance returns on your
                investment.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Continuous Monitoring and Support</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We continuously monitor market trends and your investments, providing you with real-time updates and
                support. Our dedicated team is always available to assist you.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent Reward Structure</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our transparent reward structure ensures you know exactly what to expect. We provide clear information
                on potential returns and fees, so you can make informed decisions about your Funds.</p>

            </div><!-- End Tab 2 Content -->

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="Staking">

              <p class="fst-italic">Our seasoned fund managers work diligently to optimize your investments, driving
                consistent growth while minimizing risks.
                We handle the complexities of the market so you can achieve your financial goals with peace of mind.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Stable Passive Income</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our staking services allow you to earn steady, passive income on your investments. By staking your
                assets, you can generate rewards without the need for constant trading or market timing.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Secure Staking Environment</h4>
              </div>
              <p>We prioritize the security of your assets in our staking program. Utilizing advanced technology and
                security protocols, we ensure that your investments remain safe while earning rewards.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>User-Friendly Staking Process</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Our intuitive platform makes staking easy for everyone, from beginners to experienced investors. With
                simple steps and clear instructions, you can start earning rewards in no time.
              </p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Staking Options</h4>
              </div>
              <p>At this time, we exclusively offer USDT staking. This approach allows you to focus on assets that match
                your investment strategy and risk preferences.</p>

              <div class="d-flex align-items-center mt-4">
                <i class="bi bi-check2"></i>
                <h4>Transparent Reward Structure</h4>
